The chunk is a re-blessed golden T1 hash dump (`goldens/juice.t1`) — deterministic sim-state hashes only. Under the OWASP lens there is no attack surface: no endpoints/authz/CSRF/sessions, no secrets or credentials (verified by content scan and the full file read), no untrusted input (the harness parser hex-validates every hash line, and the golden's `demo` field is never used in path construction), and no sensitive data exposure. The catalog_hash change `66c4324a06058860 → 250679b1940fb87b` is the documented, deliberate fold and is bound by the replay gate (ODN-11). No findings.
